{
  "an1.98:0.1": "Numbered Discourses 1.98–139 ",
  "an1.98:0.2": "The Chapter on Negligence (2nd) ",
  "an1.98:1.0": "98 ",
  "an1.98:1.1": "“Taking into account interior factors, mendicants, I do not see a single one that is so very harmful as negligence. ",
  "an1.98:1.2": "Negligence is very harmful.” ",
  "an1.98:1.3": "",
  "an1.99:1.0": "99 ",
  "an1.99:1.1": "“Taking into account interior factors, mendicants, I do not see a single one that is so very beneficial as diligence. ",
  "an1.99:1.2": "Diligence is very beneficial.” ",
  "an1.99:1.3": "",
  "an1.100:1.0": "100 ",
  "an1.100:1.1": "“Taking into account interior factors, mendicants, I do not see a single one that is so very harmful as laziness. ",
  "an1.100:1.2": "Laziness is very harmful.” ",
  "an1.100:1.3": "",
  "an1.101:1.0": "101 ",
  "an1.101:1.1": "“Taking into account interior factors, mendicants, I do not see a single one that is so very beneficial as arousing energy. ",
  "an1.101:1.2": "Arousing energy is very beneficial.” ",
  "an1.101:1.3": "",
  "an1.102-109:1.0": "102–109 ",
  "an1.102-109:1.1": "“Taking into account interior factors, mendicants, I do not see a single one that is so very harmful as having many wishes … having few wishes … lack of contentment … contentment … irrational application of mind … rational application of mind … lack of situational awareness … situational awareness …” ",
  "an1.110:1.0": "110 ",
